---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config.ts';
---
<Legal title="Terms of service" tab="terms" path="/legal/terms">
  <h2>1. What {site.name} is</h2>
  <p>{site.name} is an educational research and analytics tool for the Pakistan Stock Exchange. It is not an investment adviser, a broker, or a portfolio manager, and it never executes trades.</p>

  <h2>2. No advice</h2>
  <p>Nothing on {site.name} is personalised investment advice or a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security. All content is information only. You are solely responsible for your own investment decisions.</p>

  <h2>3. No warranty on outcomes</h2>
  <p>Past performance does not predict future results. We make no promise of returns. Investing carries risk, including the loss of capital.</p>

  <h2>4. Accounts, subscriptions and our research</h2>
  <p>Terms covering account use, subscription billing, cancellation and refunds, and ownership of our derived research (fair-value estimates, scores, debate transcripts and rankings) will be finalised here before paid plans launch. Prices shown on the site today are indicative and create no obligation on either side.</p>

  <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Terms covering acceptable use — including of the broker accountability rankings — will be finalised here.</p>
</Legal>
